{"ayah/113-1.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Falaq 113:1 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Say, &quot;I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/113-1.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Falaq 113:1 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Say, &quot;I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/113.html\">Surah Al-Falaq</a> › Verse 1</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Falaq 113:1</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ قُلْ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ الْفَلَقِ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">Say, &quot;I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والفلق: فعل بمعنى مفعول كالقبض بمعنى المقبوض فكل ما فلقه الرب فهو فلق<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/504</cite></blockquote><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن البصري</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «الفلق كل ما انفلق عن شيء: كالصبح والحب والنوى.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/504</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s113a1\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/en/ayah/113-4.html\">Next verse (113:4)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/113-4.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Falaq 113:4 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"And from the evil of the blowers in knots\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/113-4.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Falaq 113:4 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"And from the evil of the blowers in knots\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/113.html\">Surah Al-Falaq</a> › Verse 4</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Falaq 113:4</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمِن شَرِّ النَّفَّاثَاتِ فِي الْعُقَدِ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And from the evil of the blowers in knots</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">{ومن شر النفاثات} أي نفاثة في العقد لا يستعاذ منها؟<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 6/444</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">على تأثير السحر وأن له حقيقة<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 2/227</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والسواحر تستعين بالنفث استعانة بينة، وإن لم تتصل بجسم المسحور، بل تنفث على العقدة وتعقدها، وتتكلم بالسحر فيعمل ذلك في المسحور بتوسط الأرواح السفلية الخبيثة،<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 4/165</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s113a4\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/113-1.html\">Previous verse (113:1)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/113.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Surah Al-Falaq — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsir of Surah Al-Falaq — The meanings of the Qur&#x27;an in the words of Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/113.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/113.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/113.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/113.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/113.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/113.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/11